--    IupDialog(child,) ==> gDialog(child,parent,) [parent must be given at creation time]
--    cbfunc res = Icallback(`name`) ==> gfunc res = gCallback(name) [no ""]
--    IupXxxx() ==> gXxxx(), and IUP_XXX ==> TG_XXX, in general.
